(x) insufficiency of packing;

(0) insufficiency or inadequacy of marks;

(p) latent defects not discoverable by due diligence;

(q) any other cause arising without the actual fault or
privity of the carrier, or without the fault or
neglect of the agents or servants of the carrier, but
the burden of proof shall be on the person claiming
the benefit of this exception to show that neither
the actual fault or privity of the carrier nor the
fault or neglect of the agents or servants of the
carrier contributed to the loss or damage.
